# skills: Jian at level 14 (level index 13 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50) has Weapon Break and Armor Break.
# First temple battle (five enemies). Special lists three (shot ab_list, Stone Throw highlighted); Right moves
# to Armor Break (ab_list_down: "Armor Break", 6, "Lower one monster's defense"); A opens the enemy grid,
# Right moves to the second back-row enemy (battler 5), A casts on it. Expect: MP 50 -> 44, battler 5's DEF
# stage 0 -> -1 (0xFFFF) and its DEF lower, no ATK stage change, Jian leaps up, kicks without damage, and the
# DEF DOWN banner shows on it (ab_cast). Round 2: Special, Right, A opens the grid on that enemy: the name bar
# reads its name and "DEF" with a down triangle (ab_tag); A is refused with "No effect!" (ab_refused), no MP
# is taken; Right and A cast on another enemy (second drop to 44, a second DEF stage to 0xFFFF).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: MP +0x18, DEF +0x28, ATK stage +0x40, DEF stage +0x42).
# Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 13
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228E878 jian_mp
watch u16 0x0228EABC atk_stage5
watch u16 0x0228EABE def_stage5
watch u32 0x0228EAA4 def5
watch u16 0x0228EA52 def_stage4
watch u16 0x0228EB2A def_stage6
watch u16 0x0228EC02 def_stage8
watch u16 0x0228EC6E def_stage9
watch u16 0x0228ECDA def_stage10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
shot ab_list
press Right 8
wait 30
shot ab_list_down
press A 8
wait 70
shot ab_grid
press Right 8
wait 20
press A 8
wait 165
shot ab_cast
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 600
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 80
shot ab_tag
press A 8
wait 20
shot ab_refused
wait 80
press Right 8
wait 20
shot ab_other
press A 8
wait 250
shot ab_cast2
